  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Alert (IA) is one of the world&#x2019;s leading peacebuilding NGOs, and has worked for over 30 years on issues which are also priorities for the Irish Government. IA has a strong track record working in fragile and conflict affected states and influencing key policies and practices including conflict prevention, conflict-sensitivity, gender, preventing violent extremism, natural resource mangament, the role of the private sector in peace and conflict, and climate change. This programme will align climate action with peacebuilding approaches in climate-vulnerable and conflict-affected contexts in Kenya and Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
